          <a aria-label="MicroAgent: Context-Augmented Multi-agent Framework for Automatic Microservice Decomposition (ASE'26)" class="short-ref" href="https://doi.org/10.1145/3832783.3834441" title="MicroAgent: Context-Augmented Multi-agent Framework for Automatic Microservice Decomposition (ASE'26)">[MicroAgent, ASE'26]</a>
          <a aria-label="AdverIntent-Agent: Adversarial Reasoning for Repair Based on Inferred Program Intent (ISSTA'25)" class="short-ref" href="https://doi.org/10.1145/3728939" title="AdverIntent-Agent: Adversarial Reasoning for Repair Based on Inferred Program Intent (ISSTA'25)">[AdverIntent-Agent, ISSTA'25]</a>
          <a aria-label="PhoenixRepair: Rethinking Repair Strategy Exploration in Software Agents (arXiv'26)" class="short-ref" href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.18859" title="PhoenixRepair: Rethinking Repair Strategy Exploration in Software Agents (arXiv'26)">[PhoenixRepair, arXiv'26]</a>
        </li>
