          <a aria-label="AlignCoder: Aligning Retrieval with Target Intent for Repository-Level Code Completion (ASE'25)" class="short-ref" href="https://conf.researchr.org/details/ase-2025/ase-2025-papers/34/AlignCoder-Aligning-Retrieval-with-Target-Intent-for-Repository-Level-Code-Completio" title="AlignCoder: Aligning Retrieval with Target Intent for Repository-Level Code Completion (ASE'25)">[AlignCoder, ASE'25]</a>
