          <a aria-label="WebDesignIter: Co-Evolving Design Knowledge for Repository-Level Front-End Code Generation (arXiv'26)" class="short-ref" href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.10621" title="WebDesignIter: Co-Evolving Design Knowledge for Repository-Level Front-End Code Generation (arXiv'26)">[WebDesignIter, arXiv'26]</a>
        </li>
