          <a aria-label="SWE Data Construction, Automatically! (FSE'26)" class="short-ref" href="https://doi.org/10.1145/3797119" title="SWE Data Construction, Automatically! (FSE'26)">[SWE-Factory, FSE'26]</a>
          <a aria-label="SWE-Prime: Fewer Trajectories, Better Performance (arXiv'26)" class="short-ref" href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.27449" title="SWE-Prime: Fewer Trajectories, Better Performance (arXiv'26)">[SWE-Prime, arXiv'26]</a>
          <a aria-label="EvoGuard: Mitigating Degradation in Online Skill Evolution (arXiv'26)" class="short-ref" href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.06444" title="EvoGuard: Mitigating Degradation in Online Skill Evolution (arXiv'26)">[EvoGuard, arXiv'26]</a>
          <a aria-label="RSI-Prime: Training Models to Train Models (arXiv'26)" class="short-ref" href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.23138" title="RSI-Prime: Training Models to Train Models (arXiv'26)">[RSI-Prime, arXiv'26]</a>
        </li>
